  "commentary": "We have our blue Zerg representing TCM. It is Sorki. Got to have a big confidence boost after that game one. I think that's probably one of the best sort of games to win as a player when you're on the back foot and you're kind of fighting in this really down and dirty messy situation. And then you kind of come back and you tear your opponent's economy apart with this like two pro encounter attack and then capitalizing and crush their army from all sides. That's one of the best feelings for Sorki. So he's got to really ride that energy now and I think it's going to give him a lot of confidence going into this map. And we're going to have gas opening here from Bjorn to start things off as well. So potentially just the straight over to Reaper and then just poking around see what's going on.",
